id: pm-vqwery
title: Bound Windows script regression admission with complete deterministic shards
description: "Main CI39473954236 at849dbf00515160f207738f555371fe254cbd020a canceled the Windows scripts cohort after its enforced12-minute job budget; the required Windows aggregate then failed closed. The preceding source PR passed the same suite, so passing one warm attempt does not establish durable bounded admission. Partition the complete existing scripts directory into two deterministic Vitest shards while preserving all native guards, the12-minute cap, worker limit and required aggregate."
