comments[3]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-20T18:44:46.411Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check: the complete initial all-status read plus fresh Windows scripts and Windows cohort keyword searches found no exact open shard-admission leaf. Full live parent pm-bj7rq0 retains the broader startup and runner qualification work; older Windows portability and allocation fixes remain completed. This leaf owns the newly observed required-check budget failure and its complete partition repair."
  "2026-10-20T18:49:28.940Z","harness:codex","Negative control: the strengthened complete-partition contract fails before the workflow repair because the original matrix has no complete shard family. GitHub annotations confirm job118805667850 exceeded the exact12m0s cap, rather than an asserted product failure. The repaired matrix retains max-parallel2 and maxWorkers2, the12-minute timeout and the unchanged required all-cohort aggregate. Native guard commands and verified Cygwin provisioning remain intact. All21 workflow contract tests pass; actual hosted shard timing remains required."
  "2026-10-20T18:51:44.741Z","harness:codex","Partition evidence: Vitest file-only list returns the full104-file inventory even when passed a shard option, so that output alone cannot certify a partition. Invoking the actual installed Vitest BaseSequencer on the discovered specifications yields52 and52 files, disjoint with a complete104-file union; runtime sharding is independent of timing caches. The21-test workflow contract also retains rejection of failed canceled skipped or absent aggregate results. Hosted Windows execution remains the acceptance for runtime budgeting."
